				<r3d:description language="eng">The Research Data Center Elections is part of GESIS, provides access to a number of national survey datasets and offers researchers access to survey and election data.

Furthermore, by processing and documenting the data, the RDC Elections grants long-term usability for research and teaching, scientific value-added services, knowledge transfer and research. The project is linked to GESIS&#039; focus on survey and election research. Among other things, this includes federal and state elections, the Politbarometer and various individual studies.</r3d:description>
